## Maintainer Model

- LLM role: maintain the knowledge graph, summarize changes, and keep cross-links coherent
- User role: approve evidence, steer priorities, and judge when a synthesis should become canonical

## Stats

- Papers ingested: `= length(filter(pages("Paper Distill/sources/notes"), (p) => p.citekey))`
- Papers compiled: `= length(filter(pages("Paper Distill/wiki/papers"), (p) => p.citekey))`
- Concepts: `= length(pages("Paper Distill/wiki/concepts"))`
- Methods: `= length(pages("Paper Distill/wiki/methods"))`
- Topics: `= length(pages("Paper Distill/wiki/topics"))`

## Recent Papers

```dataview
TABLE year, join(topics, ", ") as Topics
FROM "Paper Distill/sources/notes"
WHERE citekey
SORT ingested DESC
LIMIT 10
```

## Topics

```dataview
LIST
FROM "Paper Distill/wiki/topics"
SORT file.name ASC
```

